---
// "not not technical", with the middle "not" handwritten in.
---

<a class="logo" href="/" aria-label="Not Not Technical, home">
  <span>not</span>
  <span class="logo-not">not</span>
  <span>technical</span>
</a>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .logo-not {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-hand);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
